{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50234","headline":"登岐州城楼 · 皇甫斌","name":"登岐州城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岐雍三秦地，登临实壮哉！客心关外断，秋气陇头来。\n归目浮云蔽，寒衣早雁催。\n他乡有时菊，留赏故人盃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}